### marketing/clawhub-card.md  [docs]
- # ClawHub Publish Card — RAAI Knowledge Base PRO
- **Display name:** RAAI Knowledge Base PRO
- **Slug:** raai-knowledge-base-pro
- **Category:** Skill
- **One-line outcome:** Stop losing time because knowledge lives in chats and in people’s heads.
- **Use when:** Answers are repeated manually, onboarding depends on a few people, and SOPs/FAQs are scattered across docs and chats.
- **What it does:** Creates one source of truth for FAQ, SOP, onboarding, search, and knowledge-gap audits.
- **Before → After:** scattered docs and slow onboarding → one searchable source of truth with audit flow.
